    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 09:31:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一集是《芯片简史》的第一章第2节第4部分，讲述了海森堡提出了不确定性原理，薛定谔提出了波动方程，构建了量子物理学大厦的框架，并为将来解释半导体奠定了基础。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本播客：阅读并解读《芯片简史》的内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更新频次：每周六晚8点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>附图：</span></p><span></span><p><span>电子云：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fps96Wn7CuHt73-8mCp5RsnHuKuM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>晶体结构：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_0S24Qy2Y9hrnwHaDBAPk1ZkWy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3OeX7XHLWOZjtL6n61PJ8rDBst.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>电子波：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjhoGX1621kVqXy9U1etloJPvj3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>德国物理学家海森堡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJ0AXQLlnbU6NknQ5Mq4X759CDO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>奥地利物理学奖薛定谔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftw70fKxWPi5KWE9WWjWAuFWxw7d.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>《芯片简史》的荣誉：第十九届文津图书奖、2023豆瓣科学新知年度图书、2023南国书香节十大好书、2024书香羊城十大好书、第三期新发现科普书单、环球科学2023最美阅读、21世纪经济报道年度好书2023。</span></p><span></span><p><span>链接：</span><a href="https://wangbo66.com/books/%e8%8a%af%e7%89%87%e7%ae%80%e5%8f%b2" data-url="https://wangbo66.com/books/%e8%8a%af%e7%89%87%e7%ae%80%e5%8f%b2"><span>芯片简史介绍和勘误表</span></a><span> ，豆瓣上的</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36357053/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36357053/"><span>《芯片简史》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>公众号&amp;视频号：汪波偶遇科学</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftq1d9xcGQBclsfAVqjVgX761xHP.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
